<title>GERMANY: Fresenius sees further positive trend.</title>
<headline>Fresenius sees further positive trend.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fresenius AG, a German developer and manufacturer of medical products, said in a statement on Friday it expected its &quot;positive trend to continue&quot;.</p>
<p>Fresenius reported group pre-tax profit of 153 million marks ($101.2 million) in the nine months to September 30 compared to 111 million marks in the year-ago period.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
